  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: TeamEscalationRecipientsDoctorReport.recipients and EscalationRecipientsDoctorReport.daemon are now Vec<AgentName>; ax6.rs::daemon_recipients/team_report map raw storage strings through AgentName::from_validated at the crate boundary. The secondary note (source: String) was also addressed: added EscalationRecipientSource enum (DaemonDefault/Team) with a Display impl preserving the original 'daemon default'/'team' wire text. Personally-run cargo test -p agent-team-mail-core (597 tests, all green) and clippy clean at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
